1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:01,952
Hello, I'm Camille.

2
00:00:02,302 --> 00:00:06,406
Today: when artificial intelligence imitates the voice of your loved ones.

3
00:00:07,106 --> 00:00:11,530
You get a call, or a voice message, from a loved one in distress, from an unknown number.

4
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:16,928
The voice is perfectly imitated: a few seconds of recording found online are enough.

5
00:00:17,278 --> 00:00:20,966
They have an urgent problem, and they ask you for money, in secret.

6
00:00:21,666 --> 00:00:23,242
How do you beat this trap?

7
00:00:23,592 --> 00:00:26,624
Hang up, and call your loved one back on their usual number.

8
00:00:26,974 --> 00:00:29,846
Ask a question only they know the answer to.

9
00:00:30,196 --> 00:00:35,612
Better still: choose a secret family password today, to ask for in an emergency.

10
00:00:36,312 --> 00:00:39,728
That's the lesson of the Wolf and the Kid: show me your white paw!

11
00:00:40,428 --> 00:00:42,692
Two safeguards are better than one.

12
00:00:43,042 --> 00:00:45,906
That was Camille, for Prometis. See you soon!
